Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Eighth Episode\NThe Iron Lion
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, blinded,\Nwas taken away by Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:02:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, saved by Hecate,\Nshe learned that the King and the Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.66,0:02:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...were on the Island of Serpents,\Ntransformed into stone statues.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,While trying to save them,\Nshe fell into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She is saved by the pirate Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.18,0:02:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With him, she goes to the Magic Spring\Nto heal her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the magic water of the\Nspring, she regains her sight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...and with the pirate Blood's ship\Nshe sets off for Coolland...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,..to fight\NQueen Icicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, enjoy\N"The Iron Lion."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Island of Serpents!\NThere is the Island of Serpents!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...\NMother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am, safe and sound,\Nthanks to your protection...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that of a friend\Nonce helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how much I want to help you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but even if I came there,\Nnow I could do nothing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the help of Mephisto\NI cannot break...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...this infamous spell\Nthat holds you prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must try to thwart\Nthe plans of Queen Icicle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,sovereign of Coolland.\NAnd I must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until I have\Naccomplished this. Be patient!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, father, mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see that I will soon defeat\Nthe damned Queen Icicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take something to offer as a tribute\Nto Queen Icicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- If you take this away from me...\N- That! Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Please!\NLeave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give it back to me!\N- Grandpa! Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way! Queen Popsicle is\Nwaiting for us! Let's go, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a shame!\N- It's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Take it to the\NQueen with my compliments!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They come day and night\Nto steal the merchandise...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...and they always steal from\Nme because it's the finest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! Good morning everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This fruit looks delicious. Tell\Nme, how much does it cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know how much it costs? Well,\Nthen you aren't one of those from the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, indeed!\NI am the ghost knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost knight!\NWelcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, this fruit is the best\Nand cheapest in all of Coolland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And what would be different\Nif I came from the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, ghost knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen's soldiers and followers\Nnever pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Grandpa and everyone\Nelse are always angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! They don't pay?\NIs she that stingy, this Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Watch out!\N- If we speak ill of the Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:07:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the soldiers arrest us! Therefore\Nit's better not to talk about it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the Queen's\Norders well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens to those\Nwho speak ill of her, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I only said what\Ncrossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up! One must not\Ndisobey the laws of Coolland!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Grandpa, you don't have to apologize!\N- What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to know what\NI want to do, I'll tell you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want to fight you!\N- Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you want to hear me\Nspeak ill of the Queen, here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn the Queen of Coolland!\NShe is stupid, fat, and dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!\NI won't let you talk like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Step forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurrah!\N- Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The soldier of Coolland\Nisn't as strong as he seems!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not strong, he's a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!\NGet him, dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How they exaggerate! It's\Nas if they were really at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! Someone's coming!\NLet's hope they don't see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we try\Nto set a trap for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you, go back to the market immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If the ghost knight\Nshould arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,observe him closely and follow him,\Nbut discreetly, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Discreetly,\Nbut you must investigate thoroughly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, of course! Alright!\N- I think I know that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, he was at the market!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think\Nthere was a spy there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how they manage\Nto find out so quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...who speaks ill of the Queen!\NWhat a terrible country!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a particularly\Ndelicate moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we must be\Nvery careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,because of this new weapon\Nthat we've just made!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So you did it,\Nthe iron lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't speak so loudly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- You can go now.\N- See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, my friends,\Nwork with great care!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.94,0:10:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- And who are you?\N- Come on, Gelo, don't make such a fuss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to see the new weapon right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be the ghost knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How young you are!\NFollow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So many barrels are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all full of the wine needed\Nfor the inhabitants of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The new weapon is down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange this underground road is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this piece of iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Do you really\Nnot know it? It’s a train!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get on with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you afraid, ghost knight?\N- Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can reach the new weapon\Nwith this train, then I'm getting on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've seen you\Nsomewhere else before!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're quite mistaken.\NIt's the first time I've seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, look how fast it's going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?! I can jump too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The siren!\NThey're looking for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't found\Nthat damned ghost knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you slackers, look\Nfor him! Search thoroughly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is arriving!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, my Queen!\NWelcome, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:14:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gelo, I thank you for the work you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that you've completed\Nthe new weapon. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me there immediately,\NI'm very impatient to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, of course!\N- It's that way, Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the ghost knight might arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful!\NIt's wonderful, Gelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And how does this iron lion work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you please explain it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the hole on the lion's forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,From that hole, with the power of steam,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- a hundred arrows are being launched!\N- A hundred arrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! With them we will be able to\Nbreak through the walls of any castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then test it right now!\N- Test it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Line up the prisoners under\Nthe cliff and try to knock it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons are completely\Nuseless if they don't kill people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the lion assist\Nin the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Send the laziest ones!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.18,0:16:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How cruel the Queen is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Tink is there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him, please! Do you\Nsee how the steam is coming out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, where are you?\NFather who art in heaven, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to die and I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Ghost Knight!\N- The Ghost Knight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sapphire! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are you doing here, Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Those damn soldiers\Nbrought me here on the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- My Queen, are you alright?\N- What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to put the power\Nof the iron lion to the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Fire the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What power!\NAdmirable, Gelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ghost Knight must\Nhave been blown to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- I really hope so!\N- He is definitely dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway,\Ncursed ghost knight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,before dying\Nyou were able to experience my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, soldiers,\NI beg you to give me your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight for the cause\Nof your Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is always\Nin your hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Silverland! Let's show them\Nhow strong we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Everyone look!\NFrom here we can see Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as you pass the hill\Nhead inland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, they are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We must prevent the iron lion\Nfrom entering Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, mother,\Nplease, protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This arrow\Nwill decide the fate of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?\NIt's turning back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it possible? What are you all doing?\NGo forward! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!\NWell done, it's retreating!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We won!\NI beat the iron lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.34,0:21:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.66,0:22:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.38,0:22:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is dead!\NTink, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.50,0:22:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure\Nthat you went straight to heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.26,0:22:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Who is it? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate!\N- I have been looking for you for a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to warn you that your\Nfather and your mother are in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Are they in danger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.74,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- My father is furious and has\Nthreatened to tear the statues to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.34,0:22:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, God!\N- I can't stop him anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My father won't calm\Ndown until you go to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then I will go at once.\NTake me there, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- But if you go there, he will\Nsteal your heart, you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:22:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am prepared for even that!\NTake me to the Island of Serpents!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NIf you really want to, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But is Tink, Sapphire's best friend, really dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.62,0:23:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What will become of Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,persecuted by the Queen of Coolland and by Mephisto?
